  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "建築思潮與實踐",
    "sub_ename": "ARCHITECTURAL THOUGHTS AND PRACTICES",
    "describe_ch": "本課程主要目的在提供建築專業領域中建築設計思潮歷程以及實務案例賞析。本課程強調在相關文獻閱讀以及心得報告寫作，並且透過小組討論方式來深入了解經典設計作品的設計理念。",
    "describe_eh": "The main purpose of this course is to provide an overview of the historical development of architectural design trends and practical case analyses in the field of architecture. The course emphasizes reading relevant literature, writing reflective reports, and delves into the design concepts of classic architecture projects through group discussions.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
