    "course_pol": null,
    "course_pol_en": "Students must arrive on time for class. \nCellphones, iPads, or computer are not permitted during class, if not when needed for assignments.\nAll students are expected to interact with respect in class and to behave reasonably, responsibly, and courteously at all times.\nStudents must listen attentively when classmates present or ask questions.\nWhen giving presentations, students must use ad appropriate tone.",
